@startuml LockOpen-SampleDrawer
skinparam BoxPadding 20

actor User as user

box "Instrument" #LightGrey
	participant Client.Features #LightSkyBlue
	participant Client.Notifications.Services #LightSkyBlue
	participant gRPC #LightGreen
end box

box "Pharos-Server" #LightSkyBlue
	participant Application.Instrument.Grpc #LightGreen
	participant Application.Instrument.Commands
	participant Application.Infrastructure.Notifications
end box

'Open sample drawer'
user -> gRPC : Open sample drawer

'Send instrument storage'
note over Application.Instrument.Grpc: PharosServiceImplementation.cs
gRPC -> Application.Instrument.Grpc : grpc LockOpen
Application.Instrument.Grpc -> Application.Instrument.Commands : Send LockOpenCommand
Application.Instrument.Commands -> Application.Infrastructure.Notifications : _hub.CompartmentSampleDrawerOpenInProgress
note over Application.Infrastructure.Notifications: Hubs\\InstrumentHub.cs
note over Application.Infrastructure.Notifications: Get SignalR group for this instrument, and send message.
Application.Infrastructure.Notifications --> Client.Notifications.Services: HubContext.Clients.Group(DefaultGroup).CompartmentSampleDrawerOpenInProgress()
note over Client.Notifications.Services: Listening on\nIInstrumentHub.CompartmentSampleDrawerOpenInProgress
Client.Notifications.Services --> Client.Notifications.Services: InstrumentStateNotificationProvider\n->\nInstrumentNotificationService
note over Client.Features: Listening on\nCompartmentSampleDrawerOpenInProgressEventHandler\nin InstrumentNotificationService
Client.Notifications.Services --> Client.Features: CompartmentBarView.razor.cs
note over Client.Features: Make progress bar move

@enduml